  s0: Old session and a queued input
  s1: Seed committed at the queue head#59; gate holds it
  s2: Restart holds the transition and fence
  s3: Close refused or unconfirmed
  s4: Failure answered#59; seed still to withdraw
  s5: Visible failure#59; inputs still owned
  s6: Visible failure#59; inputs settled
  s7: Clear dropped the seed#59; its teardown still to run
  s8: Clear won: seed dropped, selector forgotten
  s9: Clear gave up on the transition#59; selector still kept
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: Commit the seed original (acceptance)
  s1 --> s2: Terminate takes transition and fence
  s2 --> s2: User clear reads the row or Clear discards the queue with receipts
  s2 --> s3: Close refused, unconfirmed or row moved on
  s3 --> s4: Answer the failure, release
  s4 --> s5: Withdraw the seed
  s5 --> s6: Submit an input to the still-current session or Clear discards the queue with receipts
  s3 --> s3: Clear's terminate times out on the transition
  s4 --> s7: Withdraw the seed
  s4 --> s8: Withdraw the seed
  s4 --> s6: Withdraw the seed
  s7 --> s8: Clear ends the execution and forgets the selector
  s4 --> s9: Withdraw the seed
